  "title": "Aloo Palak (Stir-Fried Indian Potatoes and Spinach)",
  "description": "This popular Indian dish of potatoes, tomatoes, and spinach, or aloo palak, incorporates the flavors of garlic, ginger, cumin, and coriander.",
